{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"869fda4b5ac5f4c81dc1a5356b05c5e8e5230ac848d99b5caf5ba986154586b3","ja":"ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー、ワン、ツー……。\nえっと、ここで移動して……。","zh":"一、二、三、四、一、二……。\n呃，要在这里移动……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d47761bf1bb8373c6958ef51be845da6f29c049cef94fbf61b71effb09fb5e93","ja":"あれ？　未来、そこの振り、\nまた右と左が逆になってるよ。","zh":"咦？未来，你那里的舞步又把左右弄反了哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"bbf17173cb5f0492a5ad758799406b4a1b258fc6a1f473f1ccf2ff740184f0a3","ja":"えっ……！？　あ～っ、ホントだ～……。\nえへへへ……。","zh":"诶……！？啊～，真的耶～……。\n嘿嘿嘿……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"4fb82ef4059f84517f41a35cfd4a00cb4a609911e404213c8679bcb8c2065c70","ja":"えへへへ……じゃないでしょ？　このあと\n『ストロベリーポップムーン』のリハーサルなのに。","zh":"嘿嘿嘿……不对吧？接下来可是『Strawberry Pop Moon』的彩排。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"236585ddf206827fab3b52ccd3f435b4842354bde6b50724eb78dfcdc7f4f5a8","ja":"あ、もうそんな時間なの？\n呼びに来てくれたんだ？　ありがと♪","zh":"啊，已经到这个时间了吗？\n你是来叫我的吗？谢谢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"fcbe74e7db92e49483a8e152bb1bbec24b562db1b6d771096752789806285d7f","ja":"あ、その……まだちょっと早いんだけど。\nレッスンルームに、未来がいなかったから……。","zh":"啊，那个……现在还稍微早了点。\n因为我在训练室没看到未来……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"3ade528fd3ddab1b71a574d5f067bc9caa58e3e0c02c7aeabb0a06bc612b488c","ja":"でもちょうどいいわ。\n翼、私達もここで一緒に練習していきましょ。","zh":"不过正好合适。\n翼，我们也在这里一起练习吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"60c1664ec81ebb7e3d7d24fe680a7ceb85ce3a1773aa14e86db54a995b9d6f70","ja":"えーっ、今から？　今日はリハがあるんだから、\nそこでやればいいじゃない。","zh":"诶——现在开始吗？今天还有彩排，在那里做不就好了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"d45ef3e1667842a677f79ef14083ba3db847e7ed7642aab47b54133f68a30617","ja":"最低限の動きをリハで練習してたら、\n他のことが確認できなくなるじゃない。","zh":"要是在彩排中只练习最低限度的动作，就没法确认其他事情了吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"80a031edce96a28bae6dc6f8fc43b7631f1725e8e632e30ba87d6c6dbea01dd0","ja":"ごめんね、翼。みんなで合わせたら私、\n本番の感覚を思い出せると思うから。","zh":"对不起，翼。我想只要大家一起合练，我就能找回正式演出的感觉。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_877.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"09b64241bf9b8c76f8a7a3318f096921ef9dbe7b6b727e6a9e0d9bf958023b02","ja":"も～、しょうがないな～……。","zh":"真是的，拿你没办法……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
